# Keep LF in the working tree on every OS (git for Windows defaults to core.autocrlf=true, which checks out CRLF and
# makes Prettier, shell scripts and line-based parsers misbehave). PowerShell scripts stay CRLF for Windows tooling.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.db binary
